### 2. Industrial IoT - Predictive Maintenance System

#### **Theoretical Foundation**

Predictive maintenance uses **real-time sensor data and machine learning** to forecast equipment failures before they occur, shifting from reactive maintenance (repair when broken) to proactive maintenance (prevent failure).

**Key Theory Concepts**:
- **Condition-Based Monitoring**: Continuous sensor data collection to assess equipment health
- **Vibration Analysis**: Frequency domain analysis to detect bearing degradation
- **Thermal Monitoring**: Temperature patterns indicate electrical or mechanical issues
- **Statistical Anomaly Detection**: Identify deviations from normal operating patterns
- **Prognostics**: Estimate Remaining Useful Life (RUL) of components

#### **Practical Example: Motor Health Monitoring**

**Scenario**: Factory Electric Motor Condition Monitoring

```
PREDICTIVE MAINTENANCE WORKFLOW:

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│         Phase 1: BASELINE ESTABLISHMENT (1-3 months)    │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Collect continuous sensor data during normal operation  │
│ ├─ Establish mean values for each sensor                │
│ ├─ Calculate standard deviations                        │
│ ├─ Create statistical "health baseline"                 │
│ └─ Theory: Normal state = mean ± std deviation          │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│        Phase 2: CONTINUOUS MONITORING (Ongoing)         │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Real-time sensor data collection and analysis           │
│ ├─ Vibration sensors (X, Y, Z accelerometers)           │
│ ├─ Temperature sensors (bearing, motor windings)        │
│ ├─ Current sensors (motor electrical draw)              │
│ ├─ Speed sensor (RPM verification)                      │
│ └─ Frequency: Every 10 seconds to 1 second              │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│         Phase 3: ANOMALY DETECTION (Real-time)          │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Statistical analysis identifies deviations              │
│ ├─ Z-Score: (Current Value - Mean) / StdDev             │
│ ├─ Anomaly threshold: Z-Score > 3.0                     │
