## Quick Reference Guide

### MQTT Topic Best Practices
```
Base/DeviceID/Sensor/Reading
Example: home/sensor1/temperature/celsius
```

### Common MQTT QoS Levels
- **QoS 0**: At most once (faster, unreliable)
- **QoS 1**: At least once (guaranteed delivery)
- **QoS 2**: Exactly once (slowest, most reliable)

### Power Consumption Guidelines
- Ultra-low power: < 1mW
- Low power: 1-100mW
- Medium power: 100mW-1W
- High power: > 1W

### Latency Requirements
- Real-time: < 100ms
- Near real-time: 100ms-1s
- Delayed: > 1s

